            The <svg class="cs-kg-mark" viewBox="0 0 133 222" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.0566 77.124L88.7529 0H112.567L58.124 60.3184C61.8265 59.7769 65.6834 59.5049 69.6953 59.5049C82.0759 59.5049 92.4905 61.7621 100.938 66.2773C109.532 70.7926 116.306 76.9102 121.258 84.6299C126.356 92.3496 129.852 101.017 131.745 110.63L112.081 111.94C110.188 101.89 105.964 93.7339 99.4092 87.4707C92.8547 81.0619 82.9499 77.8574 69.6953 77.8574C57.8975 77.8575 48.2848 80.7706 40.8564 86.5967C33.5737 92.4229 28.1842 100.143 24.6885 109.756C21.3384 119.223 19.6631 129.565 19.6631 140.78C19.6631 152.578 21.4106 163.211 24.9062 172.679C28.402 182.001 33.8646 189.429 41.293 194.964C48.7213 200.499 58.1887 203.267 69.6953 203.267C78.8716 203.267 86.8106 201.227 93.5107 197.148C100.211 192.924 105.381 187.316 109.022 180.325C112.664 173.334 114.557 165.76 114.703 157.604H70.1328V139.688H132.182V218.123H118.199L117.244 192.056C115.365 196.409 112.772 200.439 109.46 204.141C104.508 209.53 98.5353 213.826 91.5439 217.03C84.6982 220.089 77.2698 221.619 69.2588 221.619C54.6934 221.619 42.2399 218.123 31.8984 211.132C21.5571 204.14 13.6189 194.6 8.08398 182.511C4.40642 174.162 1.98444 165.032 0.816406 155.123H0.267578V149.101C0.0900474 146.382 2.5778e-06 143.609 0 140.78C0 137.991 0.0902426 135.255 0.267578 132.572V0H19.0566V77.124Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg> mark
